  "description": "Build, train and export neural networks (MLP, CNN, RNN/LSTM, Autoencoder, GAN, Transformer) from strongly-typed C# configuration — no Python code required. NeuroForge bootstraps and manages a Python/TensorFlow runtime for you, trains on image folders, CSV/Excel, NumPy arrays or built-in datasets (CIFAR-10, MNIST, IMDB), and automatically exports every model to ONNX so it runs anywhere: ML.NET, ONNX Runtime, Azure ML, edge or mobile — with no TensorFlow dependency at inference time. Windows only for now.",
